/v1/","context":{"app_id":4075740,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4075740-1846651706691340","game_id":"steam-4075740","kind":"update","title":"Little Sheep Valley is in Steam Next Fest: Tailor Shop & Ranch House Update! 🐑","summary":"Hello everyone 👋We're excited to be part of Steam Next Fest! To celebrate, we've rolled out a big update to the Little Sheep Valley demo 🎉Sheep customizationsBuild a tailor shop on your ranch and dress up your sheep! From colourful blankets and noble top hats to shiny earrings. You can now make your sheep look cute and fancy! 🎩 Ranch House & DecorationsYour ranch house can now be extended with modular pieces, and you can place decorations on walls to make your home even cozier. Plus, you can now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691340","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075740-1844115010488746","game_id":"steam-4075740","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Accessibility, Performance and QoL","summary":"Hello everyone 👋We’re excited to share the first bigger update of our Demo 🎉Accessibility, Performance and QoLThank you to everyone sending feedback our way! 🤗 Before moving on to new features, we focused on performance, accessibility and QoL improvements.Game pacingWe have received feedback that the tutorial and progression was overwhelming, throwing too many things at you at once. That makes sense as the demo was very much balanced for exhibition scenarios, where players want to experience the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T10:58:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488746","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075740-1841579228669587","game_id":"steam-4075740","kind":"announcement","title":"We'll exhibit @ Gamescom","summary":"Hello everyone 👋Let me start once again with a big thank you to everyone who has left a Steam review on our demo so far! ❤️ Your review is one of the most impactful ways you can support Little Sheep Valley at the moment.We'd love to meet you at Gamescom! Next week, we'll be exhibiting Little Sheep Valley at Gamescom in Cologne, Germany, and we would love to welcome you to our booth. You can find us at the Indie Burg, which is part of the Indie Area in Hall 10.2, Booth E020g – D021g. If you happe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T17:36:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669587","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075740-1840310314344609","game_id":"steam-4075740","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 0.2.1","summary":"Hey everyone! This is the first small patch for the demo that we released yesterday. First of all: Thank you so much for playing the demo and providing us with feedback! If you have any more – don't hesitate to share it on our Discord. ChangesWhen sheep level up their affection, they prefer eating on meadows that are more beautiful (indicated by the stars above the meadow when placing decoration items). A meadow that has not enough decorations will be ignored by a sheep with a higher affection l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T10:50:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075740-1840310314342640","game_id":"steam-4075740","kind":"announcement","title":"Little Sheep Valley demo out now! 🐑","summary":"Hello everyone 👋I’m Rouven from Redknot Games and we have some super exciting news to share: The very first demo for Little Sheep Valley has been released today! 🎉You can check out the announcement trailer below, and get the demo here:We’d like to give a big thanks to the Wholesome Games Celebration for sharing the news, and to our community on Discord who helped us playtest ♥️You’ll be able to care for a growing flock of sheep, pet sheep, and start building your cosy mediterranean retreat. The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T17:10:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342640","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4075740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4075740":"2026-10-26T01:04:23Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4075740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4919590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4075740","app_id":4075740,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"17aef68d258e09c27d15ecd41a6428f7a43ecb73bf55f3775f2ed78e63ebcb6